. With auto_reset=True, a done step returns the next episode observation/state alongside the previous episode reward/done/info. With auto_reset=False, handle termination before stepping again.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Run pip install craftax in an isolated Python environment.","Run play_craftax or play_craftax_classic for manual play.","Select Craftax-Pixels-v1 or Craftax-Symbolic-v1 explicitly; keep full Craftax and Craftax-Classic separate. Supply distinct JAX keys to reset and step, and record the auto_reset setting.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Compare survival and crafting progress using identical seeded worlds.","Separate image-only policies from symbolic-state policies.","Modify a block or recipe, invalidate texture caches when necessary, and check reset behavior.","AI 使用与评估条件","Fix observation mode, PRNG keys, episode handling and package version. Version changes affect comparability: 1.5.0 fixes first-planted-plant growth, and 1.6.0 fixes Craftax-Classic death rewards.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98],"evidence",{"_58":103,"_25":104},{"_58":101,"_25":102},{"_58":99,"_25":100},"Pinned auto-reset transition implementation","https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax/blob/c3c2e0d038c4e641f9481320c158f457f30c28f3/craftax/environment_base/environment_bases.py","Game tutorial","https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax/blob/main/tutorial.md","Installation, API and reset caveats","https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax#readme","查看许可条款",[108],"licenseUrl",{"_58":105,"_25":109},"https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax/blob/main/LICENSE","许可类别","开放许可资源","terms","provenance","资产许可","Repository material under its MIT notice; added assets need separate records.","assetLicense","代码许可","MIT.","codeLicense","开始使用",[123],"access",{"_58":124,"_25":104,"_125":126},"Free Python package","note","CPU JAX is installed by default; accelerator support needs the correct JAX build.","主要来源",[130],"